# Data and experiment artifacts (P-final 2026-11-01: blanket rule; the old
# subdir allowlist let data/agent_runs/ + data/llm_reports/ get tracked).
# Nothing under data/ is versioned. Corpus PDFs/extracted text are never
# committed either; only corpus/manifest.json + corpus/eval/ are tracked.
data/
corpus/**/*.pdf
corpus/**/*.txt
corpus/raw/
# Stray root run debris (untracked 2026-11-01; file stays in working tree).
remote_run.json
# Pytest tmp root lands in the workspace on this machine.
pytest-of-dell/
mlruns/
*.sqlite3